<title>DUBAI: TABLE-Saudi National Commercial Bank H1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Saudi National Commercial Bank H1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			    (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit			   590.3	vs	446.9</p>
<p> Net operating income	     621.1	vs	489.2</p>
<p> Total other expenses		30.8	vs	 42.2</p>
<p> Special commission income    1,751.4	vs    1,611.9</p>
<p> Special commission expenses  1,233.9	vs    1,104.4</p>
<p> Other expenses, provisions     399.5	vs	399.4</p>
<p> Total assets		    88,121.7	vs   76,499.7</p>
<p>Full name: The National Commercial Bank.</p>
<p>Note - The figures are unaudited. The Jeddah-based bank is the biggest private bank in the kingdom. -- Dubai newsroom +9714 6071 222</p>
</text>
